<title>GERMANY: German cocoa butter/liquid producers busy - trader.</title>
<headline>German cocoa butter/liquid producers busy - trader.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German cocoa butter and liquid producers were actively ordering raw materials from fixed supply contracts, trader Albrecht &amp; Dill said in a weekly report on Friday.</p>
<p>Capacity utilisation at processors was therefore high but the trend had not worked its way back into cocoa bean markets, which remained sluggish.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
